Engulfs your hands (and weapons) in a sheath of fire, dealing [23, 31, 37, 42, 46 (TL1-5; SP 100)] fire damage per melee attack and increasing all fire damage dealt by [7%, 10%, 12%, 14%, 15% (TL1-5; SP 100)].

Each hit will also regenerate [0.33, 0.67, 1.00, 1.33, 1.67 (TL1-5)] stamina.

The effects will increase with your Spellpower.
